        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "NOTE In this document, all communication after the SDP handshake uses TLS and TCP. Therefore, the parameter \"Security\" is typically set to \"TLS\" and the parameter \"Transport Protocol\" is typically set to \"TCP\". The value \"No transport layer security\" for the parameter \"Security\" is used to continue with unencrypted communication according to DIN SPEC 70121 or ISO 15118-2 with EIM.",
